<p>Initially I thought the first research ideas were pretty dumb (Digestion research, ok, but testing if a panda eating bamboo makes it Bixby-proof? And that somehow involving vivisection? That seems less like hypothesis testing and working from first principles and more like something a fourth-grader would suggest. If you have to requisition reality-bending to test something, I would assume you would need a more solid proposal.)</p>
