<p>This week, on <em>Pandas vs Pattern Screamers</em>&#8230;</p>
<p>Now, I'm okay with this. It's a cool story and an interesting concept. However, some of the prose is rather a slog to read through and more of something I have to commit to reading than something I really want to read because it's interesting. It's super inaccessible, and yeah, that's always going to be a factor when dealing with complex concepts, but I can't help but think it's not a necessity here.</p>

